{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20209",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.31,
      "end_seconds": 9.48,
      "duration_seconds": 8.17,
      "text": "Doctor, your next patient is here. I've done the the basics, I'll read them out in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.04,
      "end_seconds": 14.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "So, thank you. Right, hello, what's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 15.56,
      "end_seconds": 21.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.62,
      "text": "Hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.25,
      "end_seconds": 26.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Good, that'll be useful. Pull up a chair."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 28.16,
      "end_seconds": 36.7,
      "duration_seconds": 8.54,
      "text": "It's a burn on my left forearm, doctor. She didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 37.62,
      "end_seconds": 47.12,
      "duration_seconds": 9.5,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Heart rate 75, height 161 centimetres. BP is 120 over 79, weight 66 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.21,
      "end_seconds": 53.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Good, thank you. How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.82,
      "end_seconds": 61.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Oh, um, it's been going on for two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.95,
      "end_seconds": 71.11,
      "duration_seconds": 9.16,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.7,
      "end_seconds": 86.01,
      "duration_seconds": 13.31,
      "text": "ah, uh, I notice it more with clothes. Cool water helps a bit i've, I've had a stinging pain too, for about four days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.64,
      "end_seconds": 89.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Has there been a blister too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.2,
      "end_seconds": 98.99,
      "duration_seconds": 7.79,
      "text": "Sorry, um, what was I saying, yes, about the same, one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 99.59,
      "end_seconds": 103.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "yes, that's right, that's how it was"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.15,
      "end_seconds": 110.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Any fever, pus or trouble breathing at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.86,
      "end_seconds": 115.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "so, no, none that I've noticed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.29,
      "end_seconds": 121.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "any numbness at the burn or burn on the face at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.52,
      "end_seconds": 129.5,
      "duration_seconds": 6.98,
      "text": "I haven't had numbness at the burn or burn on the face, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.67,
      "end_seconds": 132.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.92,
      "end_seconds": 137.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Well, no, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.93,
      "end_seconds": 157.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "tell me about your eating"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.37,
      "end_seconds": 165.15,
      "duration_seconds": 6.78,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.15,
      "end_seconds": 169.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.01,
      "end_seconds": 174.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.38,
      "end_seconds": 178.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.26,
      "end_seconds": 182.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Pantoprazole, 40 milligrams, maybe, before breakfast"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.12,
      "end_seconds": 187.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.55,
      "end_seconds": 196.27,
      "duration_seconds": 7.72,
      "text": "no, it's at home i'm on fluoxetine, 20 milligrams, every morning for my mood"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 196.87,
      "end_seconds": 205.82,
      "duration_seconds": 8.95,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the fluoxetine was 10 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.74,
      "end_seconds": 210.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Alright. Did you bring the up-to-date prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.44,
      "end_seconds": 222.18,
      "duration_seconds": 9.74,
      "text": "I don't think I have it it with me. I'm, I'm on sumatriptan, when needed for my migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.81,
      "end_seconds": 230.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "how much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.84,
      "end_seconds": 236.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "50 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.04,
      "end_seconds": 238.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "And for how long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.21,
      "end_seconds": 240.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Two years now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.03,
      "end_seconds": 247.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.15,
      "end_seconds": 253.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "So, no, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.03,
      "end_seconds": 258.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 259.61,
      "end_seconds": 263.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "I have acid reflux, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.83,
      "end_seconds": 270.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "okay, and besides that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.01,
      "end_seconds": 280.52,
      "duration_seconds": 8.51,
      "text": "Ah, um, I have depression, for five years. I have migraines, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.26,
      "end_seconds": 287.51,
      "duration_seconds": 5.25,
      "text": "alright, acid reflux and depression, that matches what I have here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.64,
      "end_seconds": 298.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.28,
      "end_seconds": 314.62,
      "duration_seconds": 14.34,
      "text": "Just a meniscus repair on my knee, four years ago. I took the morning off to come in today. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.36,
      "end_seconds": 318.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.1,
      "end_seconds": 323.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.87,
      "end_seconds": 342.61,
      "duration_seconds": 8.74,
      "text": "There is a five-centimetre area of redness with an intact blister on the left forearm, and it blanches and is painful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.17,
      "end_seconds": 345.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "yeah, no problem"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 351.38,
      "end_seconds": 371.31,
      "duration_seconds": 19.93,
      "text": "You can relax now. Right, here's what I'm thinking. I don't have a clear answer today: a superficial partial-thickness burn is possible, and so is a deeper burn. It could also be a scald with infection risk, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 372.43,
      "end_seconds": 376.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "I mean, is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 377.82,
      "end_seconds": 408.62,
      "duration_seconds": 30.8,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a superficial partial-thickness burn. I'd like you to to take paracetamol, 1 gram, every six hours if needed, for three days. That's for burn pain. Cool the area under running water for twenty minutes and cover it with a non-stick dressing, and leave the blister alone. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 409.72,
      "end_seconds": 413.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Okay, I'll look out for that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 418.27,
      "end_seconds": 430.86,
      "duration_seconds": 12.59,
      "text": "if the burn becomes smelly, spreads or you get a fever, that's the point to come in urgently. I'll want another look in three days. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 431.53,
      "end_seconds": 436.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "Okay, um, so thank you, that's helpful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 438.84,
      "end_seconds": 440.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "okay, take care now"
    }
  ]
}